          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 90 SW              THE LEE              FIELD END LANE 5/104                                      Field End Grange                                            (½ mile south east of                                            Church of St John the                                            Baptist) - -                                          II House.  C16, partly clad in C18 brick.  Timber framed with C17 brick infill to gabled right hand bay and right flank elevation, remainder  of front C18 red brick.  Rear elevation roughcast.  Right hand bay is gabled cross-wing, left hand bay with large stack to left flank with clunch lower part, tiled weathering and C17 upper parts and flue.  Door at left with Gothic tracery, 3-light casement, blocked door and window. Upper floor 3-light casement, then 2-light casement to gabled and framed bay with tension braces.  Stack to right.  Leaded casements.  Interior: has large ground floor fireplace, large chamfered beams, and on first floor fireplace with stone 4-central arch.  Roof trusses have curved wind braces. RCHMI 175 MON 25 Listing NGR: SP9050303728"
    }
  ],
